    <item>
      <title>Version 1.0.4</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 15:16:21 +0700</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's new in 1.0.4</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><b>Clipboard history</b> — a new Clipboard tab keeps the text you copy; press ⌘⇧V anywhere to pick an earlier copy and paste it (auto-paste needs Accessibility).</li>
          <li><b>New Home</b> — a calm dashboard hub; the scan &amp; clean workflow now lives in its own <b>Clean Disk</b> tab.</li>
          <li><b>Refreshed interface</b> — a softer, more consistent look across every screen.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
